# ============================================================================
# MARIGOLD CITY  (metropolis, 26x23 blocks, buffer 928/1300)  johto_modern
# ============================================================================
# HOOK: Goldenrod's brash young rival across the river - the "City of Noon",
#   built by the Sunburst Power Company that lights half of Johto. Glass
#   offices, a 6-storey department tower and its own TV station (Marigold
#   TV, which keeps out-shouting Goldenrod's Radio Tower). During the
#   Eclipse the city's lights fail: something is draining Sunburst's grid
#   from the tunnels under the plaza. Gym: ELECTRIC (leader NOVA, Sunburst's
#   chief engineer); her Gym is dark and locked until the power is back.
#
# DISTRICTS / BUILDINGS (door steps in obj warp lines)
#   Broadcast Row (NW, rows 1-8)
#     Marigold TV tower (2x6 grey tower w/ spire)  lobby, quiz show, studio
#                                   lottery; roof = broadcast mast event
#     TV Studio (4x2, brick forecourt + sign)     talk-show NPCs, interviews
#     Link Center (PCC art 20/24/5f)             trades / link battles /
#                                   Mystery Gift; the 5f sign reads PCC
#     Cafe Marigold (3x2) and a house             Moomoo milk, rumours
#   Marigold Tower (3x6, dept-store glass, Mart front, facing the plaza)
#     the landmark: 6 floors + roof, rooftop sale; outranks Goldenrod's
#   Sunburst District (NE, rows 1-8)
#     Marigold Gym (4x2, 1c 0f 1d 1e, brick forecourt + sign)
#     Sunburst Power Co. HQ (2x4 grey tower, no spire)  plot building
#     Marigold Exchange (3x3 glass office)        NPC trade broker / stocks
#     Boutique (3x2), Gym trainees' dorm (2x2)
#     Underpass North (kiosk 14/13 + sign)        Marigold Underground
#   Sunrise Plaza (centre, rows 9-14)
#     2-wide Boulevard (W-E) meets the 2-wide Avenue (N-S) at a fenced
#     fountain roundabout; street trees (66) and two signs (city / plaza)
#   Grand Marigold Hotel (4x3 glass, E of plaza) PC in the lobby, paid rest,
#     replaces a Pokemon Center
#   Marigold Arcade (3x2, W of plaza)             game corner / coin prizes
#   Old Marigold (south, rows 15-21)
#     Marigold Gallery (5x2 museum), Underpass South (kiosk), Promenade
#     (brick E-W street, row 18), Bike & Scooter shop (3x2), Pokemon Fan
#     Club (3x2), homes, Sunflower pocket park (SE flowers + trees)
#
# GAMEPLAY BEATS
#   1. Arrive on the Boulevard (W or E); the Hotel is the first stop (PC,
#      rest). Marigold Tower is open but its elevator is dead (stairs only).
#   2. Blackout: Gym door shut, TV off-air. Sunburst HQ receptionist sends
#      you to an engineer who went into the Underground and never came back.
#   3. Underpass North -> Marigold Underground (shops + a cult substation
#      tapping the grid) -> boss -> exit by Underpass South.
#   4. Power back: Gym opens (NOVA), TV resumes, Tower rooftop sale and
#      elevator, Arcade lights up.
#   5. Later: Link Center, Exchange trades, Gallery exhibits by season.
#
# EXITS / CONNECTIONS
#   N  Avenue (cols 12-13)    to a northern route
#   S  Avenue (cols 12-13)    to a southern route / coast
#   W  Boulevard (rows 10-11) toward Goldenrod (rival-city road)
#   E  Boulevard (rows 10-11) toward Sorrel Junction (rail hub)
#   23 building doors, all listed below and reachable on foot.
#
# TILE GAPS / UNCERTAIN BLOCKS
#   - 5f is hard-labelled "PCC"; the Link Center uses it as-is. A neutral
#     sign variant would free 20/24 for any modern office front.
#   - No neon, lamp post, bench, statue or bus-stop blocks; street trees
#     are 66/80 (flowering) only, so the plaza reads a little bare.
#   - Only one grey tower style (21/22/25/26/29/2a/2d/2e); TV tower and
#     Sunburst HQ share it. 29/2a stacked twice looks fine.
#   - Fountain is the 40-42/44-46/48-4a fence ring with 35/61 water, as in
#     silkwater; no proper fountain or statue graphic.
#   - 67 houses are door-less decor (1-block shops/kiosks).
# NOTE: block 1d is the GYM-labelled front; used only for the Gym.
# ============================================================================
tileset johto_modern
ref GoldenrodCity
key T=05 .=01 :=06 ,=02 *=04 h=67 p=2f
key R=18 M=1f N=19 A=10 D=17 Z=11 E=1a F=0f C=1c Q=1d W=1e O=16 K=33
key 1=14 2=13 g=27 m=23 G=28 X=20 V=24 U=5f b=2b c=2c
key i=21 I=22 j=25 J=26 y=29 Y=2a d=2d k=2e
key r=40 f=41 t=42 <=44 >=46 l=48 L=4a ~=35 u=61 s=45 S=77 w=66 x=80
grid:
TTTTTTTTTTTT::TTTTTTTTTTTT
T.i.RMMN.hh.::.hRMMN.jJRNT
T.I.AFDZ.hh.::.hCFQW.yYOWT
T.I.:::S.RMN::.::::S:yY..T
T.jJ.RMN.gmG::.......dk..T
T.yY.XVU.gmG::.RMNRMN...hT
T.dk....pgmG::.gmGEFZ...hT
T..RNRMN.gmG::.ADZ...p..,T
T..OWEFZ.ADK::....p..12s.T
T......w::::::::::w......T
::::::::::::::::::::::::::
:::::::::::rfft:::::::::::
T.RMN.h::::<~~>::::.RMMN.T
T.ADZ.h::::luuL::::.gmmG.T
T,p.,p.:S::::::::S:.AcDZ.T
T...........::...........T
T.RMMMN.,12.::.RN.RN.p*p.T
T.AFDFZ.p.s.::.OW.OW.,*,.T
